{"chunk_id": "3e9ca716-d638-4463-88ad-dcde19d7e711", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "# 消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单\n\n后端项目面试中，只要你说用了 MQ，面试官很容易追问：消息丢了怎么办？重复消费怎么办？顺序消费怎么保证？延迟消息怎么关闭订单？\n\n![mq-retry](./assets/mq-retry.png)\n\n![order-timeout](./assets/order-timeout.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 165}
