{"chunk_id": "45801ce3-fe8d-4cbf-94f9-ad5cbe0ddc6f", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 一、为什么使用消息队列\n\n消息队列常用于异步解耦、削峰填谷、事件驱动。比如用户下单后，不一定同步完成所有操作，可以先创建订单，再通过消息异步处理积分、通知、库存流水等。\n\n但是使用 MQ 会引入新问题：消息可靠性、重复消费、顺序性、积压、死信、最终一致性。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 一、为什么使用消息队列", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 131}
{"chunk_id": "c0047dfb-7539-4b1a-b722-0f0d11cfeb06", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "消息队列常用于异步解耦、削峰填谷、事件驱动。比如用户下单后，不一定同步完成所有操作，可以先创建订单，再通过消息异步处理积分、通知、库存流水等。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "45801ce3-fe8d-4cbf-94f9-ad5cbe0ddc6f", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 一、为什么使用消息队列", "metadata": {"block_id": "f4777e85-2936-44d2-9982-f11646e53aa1"}, "char_len": 71}
{"chunk_id": "a560bf6f-db8e-4be9-9df4-9b4062b3270c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "但是使用 MQ 会引入新问题：消息可靠性、重复消费、顺序性、积压、死信、最终一致性。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "45801ce3-fe8d-4cbf-94f9-ad5cbe0ddc6f", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 一、为什么使用消息队列", "metadata": {"block_id": "4daf24a1-c56f-4fc3-85ef-cdd231478df5"}, "char_len": 42}
{"chunk_id": "7ac6e1b4-30a6-4cc4-a7a0-3d274e4024f5", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 二、如何保证消息不丢\n\n生产者发送消息后，需要确认 broker 收到。broker 需要持久化消息。消费者处理完成后再提交 offset 或 ack。如果中间失败，消息可以重试。\n\n但“保证不丢”通常意味着可能重复，所以消费者必须做幂等。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 二、如何保证消息不丢", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 123}
{"chunk_id": "0ea001fd-43d3-43f5-88fa-d846943297a6", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "生产者发送消息后，需要确认 broker 收到。broker 需要持久化消息。消费者处理完成后再提交 offset 或 ack。如果中间失败，消息可以重试。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7ac6e1b4-30a6-4cc4-a7a0-3d274e4024f5", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 二、如何保证消息不丢", "metadata": {"block_id": "02eaa44a-8a0f-44e0-9911-bd4ad338d538"}, "char_len": 78}
{"chunk_id": "642a5b0b-c132-4942-870b-123cd8a04591", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "但“保证不丢”通常意味着可能重复，所以消费者必须做幂等。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7ac6e1b4-30a6-4cc4-a7a0-3d274e4024f5", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 二、如何保证消息不丢", "metadata": {"block_id": "b0c070f8-78a3-4cc9-95ce-784177ca8c45"}, "char_len": 28}
{"chunk_id": "204d040b-cf18-4393-8a0f-4bd6a929f3a9", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 三、消费者幂等\n\n幂等的核心是：同一条业务消息重复到达，最终结果只能生效一次。常见方案：\n- 数据库唯一键，例如 order_id、request_no、out_trade_no；\n- Redis setnx 去重；\n- 状态机判断，只允许从 INIT 到 SUCCESS；\n- 消费记录表，处理成功后记录 message_id。\n\n例如支付回调：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE orders\nSET status = 'PAID'\nWHERE order_id = ? AND status = 'WAIT_PAY';\n```\n\n这条 SQL 天然带状态判断，多次执行不会重复把订单推进。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 三、消费者幂等", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 5}, "char_len": 298}
{"chunk_id": "9f531cc0-184b-4bca-8424-5970c1b67587", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "幂等的核心是：同一条业务消息重复到达，最终结果只能生效一次。常见方案：\n- 数据库唯一键，例如 order_id、request_no、out_trade_no；\n- Redis setnx 去重；\n- 状态机判断，只允许从 INIT 到 SUCCESS；\n- 消费记录表，处理成功后记录 message_id。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "204d040b-cf18-4393-8a0f-4bd6a929f3a9", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 三、消费者幂等", "metadata": {"block_id": "ddad91d4-347d-41fa-82ed-b34e5a6ca824"}, "char_len": 156}
{"chunk_id": "ed51d3df-afdc-40f0-a731-b6f95f2b58f0", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "例如支付回调：", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "204d040b-cf18-4393-8a0f-4bd6a929f3a9", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 三、消费者幂等", "metadata": {"block_id": "6b67b62f-7f2f-440e-82b9-c432eebb3f1c"}, "char_len": 7}
{"chunk_id": "274b6102-23a1-4645-b57a-0e74ecd7e722", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "```sql\nUPDATE orders\nSET status = 'PAID'\nWHERE order_id = ? AND status = 'WAIT_PAY';\n```", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "204d040b-cf18-4393-8a0f-4bd6a929f3a9", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "code", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 三、消费者幂等", "metadata": {"block_id": "320d56f3-745a-4486-9ca3-4834af5d33e0"}, "char_len": 88}
{"chunk_id": "e8be8930-d48d-44d3-ae3a-1e448b1e113e", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "这条 SQL 天然带状态判断，多次执行不会重复把订单推进。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "204d040b-cf18-4393-8a0f-4bd6a929f3a9", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 三、消费者幂等", "metadata": {"block_id": "5dc66253-7b50-4254-b532-e865466322b9"}, "char_len": 29}
{"chunk_id": "4f1d112c-38f9-4a31-a9f4-889d96864b2c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 四、顺序消费\n\n如果业务要求同一个订单的事件按顺序处理，可以按 order_id 做分区，让同一个 order_id 的消息进入同一个队列。这样单个队列内保持顺序。\n\n但是全局顺序代价很高，通常没有必要。面试时要区分“局部有序”和“全局有序”。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 四、顺序消费", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 125}
{"chunk_id": "816fc8a6-b243-4140-a8f1-f3968186e294", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "如果业务要求同一个订单的事件按顺序处理，可以按 order_id 做分区，让同一个 order_id 的消息进入同一个队列。这样单个队列内保持顺序。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "4f1d112c-38f9-4a31-a9f4-889d96864b2c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 四、顺序消费", "metadata": {"block_id": "108bf0da-97c0-4636-b132-2f145887f2a4"}, "char_len": 74}
{"chunk_id": "17d13c06-2056-4d96-b49e-cd250e7dd274", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "但是全局顺序代价很高，通常没有必要。面试时要区分“局部有序”和“全局有序”。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "4f1d112c-38f9-4a31-a9f4-889d96864b2c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 四、顺序消费", "metadata": {"block_id": "5a383ef3-49ad-4a09-9d8f-1ffab943f74e"}, "char_len": 38}
{"chunk_id": "39e1372e-f66d-4fde-acab-18ccd26298e4", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 五、延迟消息关闭订单\n\n秒杀或电商场景中，用户下单后 15 分钟不支付，需要关闭订单并回滚库存。可以发送延迟消息，消息到期后检查订单状态：\n\n1. 如果订单仍是 WAIT_PAY，则关闭订单；\n2. 如果已经 PAID，则忽略；\n3. 回滚库存要做幂等，避免重复回滚。\n\n回滚幂等可以用订单状态、库存流水、Redis 标记或数据库唯一键。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 五、延迟消息关闭订单", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 172}
{"chunk_id": "4c37e263-c7ee-4d95-b19c-fcdedf555b99", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "秒杀或电商场景中，用户下单后 15 分钟不支付，需要关闭订单并回滚库存。可以发送延迟消息，消息到期后检查订单状态：", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "39e1372e-f66d-4fde-acab-18ccd26298e4", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 五、延迟消息关闭订单", "metadata": {"block_id": "5623c2bf-ac5e-45cc-a6ef-02fb147adf31"}, "char_len": 57}
{"chunk_id": "31983c5f-293c-4302-b338-507809649d2a", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "1. 如果订单仍是 WAIT_PAY，则关闭订单；\n2. 如果已经 PAID，则忽略；\n3. 回滚库存要做幂等，避免重复回滚。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "39e1372e-f66d-4fde-acab-18ccd26298e4", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 五、延迟消息关闭订单", "metadata": {"block_id": "8eefcefb-cee6-4fa6-a27a-5fc085de50cf"}, "char_len": 63}
{"chunk_id": "eb88e6f0-d7cd-4cf6-8f2e-1df159bf6661", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "回滚幂等可以用订单状态、库存流水、Redis 标记或数据库唯一键。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "39e1372e-f66d-4fde-acab-18ccd26298e4", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 五、延迟消息关闭订单", "metadata": {"block_id": "46b90c49-7a2e-4a95-b7dd-fd904ed985f7"}, "char_len": 33}
{"chunk_id": "d3f54730-8138-4c72-bccb-442fa0d3b468", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 六、消息积压怎么办\n\n消息积压时先判断是生产太快、消费太慢，还是消费者异常。常见处理：\n- 扩容消费者；\n- 临时提升批量消费；\n- 排查慢 SQL / 外部接口；\n- 把大任务拆小；\n- 对死信单独处理。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 六、消息积压怎么办", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 106}
{"chunk_id": "092a31ef-418b-4730-a7c8-8ea464032066", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "消息积压时先判断是生产太快、消费太慢，还是消费者异常。常见处理：\n- 扩容消费者；\n- 临时提升批量消费；\n- 排查慢 SQL / 外部接口；\n- 把大任务拆小；\n- 对死信单独处理。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "d3f54730-8138-4c72-bccb-442fa0d3b468", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 六、消息积压怎么办", "metadata": {"block_id": "4ceb85ad-6d2c-434b-91e5-1b9b9d5f964a"}, "char_len": 92}
{"chunk_id": "f1b25db2-feba-4470-9841-14e6283b5b38", "doc_id": "xiaolin_005_mq_idempotency", "text": "## 广告与版权\n\n关注小林 coding，回复「MQ」领取消息队列面试题。  \n推荐阅读：图解 RocketMQ、图解 Kafka、图解分布式事务。  \n本文仅用于学习交流，禁止洗稿。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "消息队列幂等、顺序消费和延迟关单 > 广告与版权", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 93}
